      "## Confidentiality, privacy law, and privilege are separate",
      "The counselor may have overlapping duties:",
      "- **Ethical confidentiality** governs professional handling of client information.\n- **Privacy law** governs covered uses and disclosures.\n- **Evidentiary privilege** may allow a client or another privilege holder to resist compelled testimony or production.\n- **Procedural law** governs subpoenas, objections, and court orders.",
