      "## HIPAA examples without overgeneralizing",
      "For a HIPAA covered entity:",
      "- A court order can permit disclosure of the protected health information specifically described in the order.\n- A subpoena or discovery request not accompanied by a court order may require additional conditions, such as satisfactory assurances that the person seeking the information gave the individual notice or sought a qualified protective order, or another valid pathway under the rule.\n- The minimum-necessary standard and other Privacy Rule provisions may affect the response.",
