      "- Confirming dates of service instead of producing content\n- Producing a treatment summary rather than raw notes, when accepted and appropriate\n- Redacting information about other people\n- Separating specially protected records\n- Limiting a court-ordered disclosure to named documents and dates\n- Seeking in-camera review by the court\n- Requesting a protective order governing access, use, storage, and destruction\n- Objecting or moving to quash when permitted",
