    "reviewedOn": "2026-08-19",
    "appliedExample": "A former client posts a one-star review naming the counselor and making an inaccurate claim about treatment. The counselor should not respond, “You stopped attending after I diagnosed you with…” A safer response, if one is made, is a general statement that does not confirm any relationship and directs concerns to a private process. The counselor can preserve the review, consult policy or counsel, and address factual business concerns without disclosing confidential information.",
